msgid "Add a footer tab"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Apart from adding a card and a page, extensions can add a tab to the footer. "
"This is useful for things that are happening continuously. A page will lose "
"connection to the backend when navigating away from that page, and a log in "
"the footer will be permanently connected."
